[statement]
As `a-requirer-another-pending-name-could-require-waits`, with the name
that could require `w` carried: `ku`, a pending carried name, depends on
`w`, and is decided first in any case. `w` is still decided before `v`,
and `kw` answers `v`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:ku v

P:ku
V:1
D:v w

P:kw
V:1
D:dep
p:v w=1

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:v

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install dep 1
install kw 1
install ku 1
install app 1
